        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Add EXT_polygon_offset_clamp WebGL extension]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30843</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30843"/>
        <updated>2026-10-12T06:34:34.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105274?u=173310b843e2751843265438af8cfb79eda02039&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Adds <code class="notranslate">api.EXT_polygon_offset_clamp</code> and <code class="notranslate">api.EXT_polygon_offset_clamp.polygonOffsetClampEXT</code>: Chrome 122, Firefox 158, Safari 17.4, the rest mirrored</li>
</ul>
<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Firefox 158: available by default in WebGL 1 and WebGL 2 contexts: <a href="https://bugzil.la/1854003" rel="nofollow">https://bugzil.la/1854003</a></li>
<li>Chrome 122: available by default: <a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/chromium/chromium/commit/0c83005fec36/hovercard" href="https://github.com/chromium/chromium/commit/0c83005fec36">chromium/chromium@<tt>0c83005fec36</tt></a></li>
<li>Safari 17.4: available by default: <a href="https://commits.webkit.org/270382@main" rel="nofollow">https://commits.webkit.org/270382@main</a></li>
<li>Tested in Firefox Nightly 159: <code class="notranslate">getExtension()</code> returns the extension on WebGL 1 and WebGL 2 contexts, and <code class="notranslate">polygonOffsetClampEXT()</code> sets <code class="notranslate">POLYGON_OFFSET_CLAMP_EXT</code></li>
</ul>
