        <title type="html"><![CDATA[html/elements/iframe: add local-network, local-network-access, and loopback-network allow directives]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30833</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30833"/>
        <updated>2026-10-10T21:26:55.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185269030?u=1fc22565ccf4566b6f734fabaa87e03d9a31cfe4&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #30831.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5795287046" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30831" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30831/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30831">#30831</a></p>
<p dir="auto">Adds three missing Permission Policy directive entries to <code class="notranslate">html.elements.iframe.allow</code>:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><code class="notranslate">local-network</code>: Chrome 145, Firefox 153, <code class="notranslate">experimental: false</code></li>
<li><code class="notranslate">loopback-network</code>: Chrome 145, Firefox 153, <code class="notranslate">experimental: false</code></li>
<li><code class="notranslate">local-network-access</code>: Chrome 142, Firefox false, <code class="notranslate">experimental: true</code> (legacy alias, superseded by the two above)</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">Firefox support verified via Bugzilla bug <a href="https://bugzil.la/1978550" rel="nofollow">1978550</a> (RESOLVED FIXED); <code class="notranslate">network.lna.blocking</code> defaults to true from the Firefox 153 release tag.</p>
<p dir="auto">Note: <code class="notranslate">http.headers.Permissions-Policy</code> entries for these directives correctly remain <code class="notranslate">false</code> — Firefox has not implemented HTTP header parsing for Permissions-Policy (bug <a href="https://bugzil.la/1531012" rel="nofollow">1531012</a> is still open).</p>]]></content>
